{"claims":[{"claim_text":"Technologies ought to be contextually appropriate, considering use value relative to social necessity, energy demand and pollution for production relative to maintenance, and durability relative to recyclability.", "claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"Support for a philosophy of convivial technology, which facilitates interpersonal connection, can be easily replicated by different people under different conditions, and can be managed democratically rather than technocratically.", "claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[2]},{"claim_text":"Certain high technologies are not opposed but embraced, especially those essential for modern material comforts and a high quality of life, on the condition their supply chains are rendered as socially and environmentally just as possible.", "claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[3]},{"claim_text":"Examples of embraced high technologies include the Internet, laptops, mobile phones, high-speed rail, GPS systems and satellites, refrigeration, air conditioning and heat pumps, solar panels, wind turbines, and rechargeable batteries.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[3]},{"claim_text":"These embraced technologies must be developed to satisfy requirements of appropriateness, including use value relative to social necessity, energy demand and pollution for production relative to maintenance, and durability relative to recyclability.", "claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[3]},{"claim_text":"Recognition of the critical role of technology in empowering the Global South to meet their needs.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[4]},{"claim_text":"Support for extensive technology transfers to and releasing of intellectual property for the Global South.", "claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[4]},{"claim_text":"The Left has an immediate task of building a multiracial, mass, working class movement to transform capitalism.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[5]},{"claim_text":"The Left must help birth a new, post-carbon cultural hegemony as soon as possible to rehabilitate, regenerate and preserve the conditions for life on Earth.", "claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[5]}],"unresolved_references":[]}
